        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As a fabless semiconductor company, we do not manufacture our own products but do maintain research and laboratory space at certain of our facilities to facilitate the development, evaluation, and testing of our products.",
        "start_character": 18464,
        "end_character": 18685
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000772406-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000772406-26-000018-247272130efc94ae",
        "accession_number": "0000772406-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-21",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The Company operates and tracks its results in one reportable segment, but reports revenue performance in two product lines: Audio and HPMS.",
        "start_character": 12863,
        "end_character": 13003
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000772406-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000772406-26-000018-247272130efc94ae",
        "accession_number": "0000772406-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-21",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also fund certain advanced-process technology development, as well as other emerging product opportunities.",
        "start_character": 13981,
        "end_character": 14091
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000772406-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000772406-26-000018-247272130efc94ae",
        "accession_number": "0000772406-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-21",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We concentrate our research and development efforts on the design and development of new products for each of our principal markets.",
        "start_character": 13848,
        "end_character": 13980
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000772406-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000772406-26-000018-247272130efc94ae",
        "accession_number": "0000772406-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-21",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We do not anticipate any material effect on our business due to any patents expiring in 2026, and we continue to obtain new patents through our ongoing research and development.",
        "start_character": 11801,
        "end_character": 11978
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000772406-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000772406-26-000018-247272130efc94ae",
        "accession_number": "0000772406-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-21",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "When we have been successful with this approach, an initial design win can often lead to an opportunity to further increase our content with a customer over time through the incorporation of new features, the integration of other system components into our products, and the addition of new products.",
        "start_character": 3348,
        "end_character": 3648
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000772406-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000772406-26-000018-247272130efc94ae",
        "accession_number": "0000772406-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-21",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "For fiscal years 2026, 2025, and 2024, we had one end customer, Apple Inc., who purchased through multiple contract manufacturers and represented approximately 91 percent, 89 percent, and 87 percent, of the Company’s total net sales, respectively.",
        "start_character": 7719,
        "end_character": 7966
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000772406-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000772406-26-000018-247272130efc94ae",
        "accession_number": "0000772406-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-21",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "The Company develops custom and general market components that embody our latest innovations, which we use to engage key players in a particular market or application.",
        "start_character": 2700,
        "end_character": 2867
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000772406-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000772406-26-000018-247272130efc94ae",
        "accession_number": "0000772406-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-21",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We believe that we offer competitive compensation and health and wellness benefits, designed to improve the quality of our employees’ lives.",
        "start_character": 21412,
        "end_character": 21552
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000772406-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000772406-26-000018-247272130efc94ae",
        "accession_number": "0000772406-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-21",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We expect to face additional competition from new entrants in our markets, which may include both large domestic and international IC manufacturers, as well as smaller, emerging companies.",
        "start_character": 15358,
        "end_character": 15546
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000772406-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000772406-26-000018-247272130efc94ae",
        "accession_number": "0000772406-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-21",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "We maintain business interruption insurance to help reduce the risk of wafer supply interruption;",
        "start_character": 9862,
        "end_character": 9959
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000772406-26-000018",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000772406-26-000018-247272130efc94ae",
        "accession_number": "0000772406-26-000018",
        "filing_date": "2026-05-21",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.9,
